  "finalText": "I built the NOVA logo reveal as a 4-second, 1920×1080 piece on a navy background (#0A1330), with mint (#2EE6A6) as the single accent. I checked it in a contact sheet and a final-frame screenshot, but didn't play it back in real time.\n\n- **Mark (0.2–1.35 s):** The white **Mark Ring** draws itself on, then the mint **Mark Slash** draws diagonally across it.\n- **Wordmark (1.35–2.15 s):** **Wordmark** \"NOVA\" slides out to the right from behind the mark. It is clipped at the mark's edge, so it emerges from behind the ring.\n- **Tagline (2.3–3.0 s):** **Tagline** \"Money, made simple\" fades up in mint, left-aligned under the wordmark.\n- **Hold:** The full lockup sits still from 3.0 s to 4.0 s, a one-second hold.\n\nThe ring first rendered with a default blue fill, which I fixed. The final frame shows the open ring with the slash.\n\nI skipped the storyboard step because your brief already fixed the concept. I can add a small pulse on the mark when the slash lands, make the tagline white instead of mint, or lengthen the hold."
